  "title": "Remnants",
  "storyCode": "1-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bcc0a112f06c82a59e8371303220b1d1df0d83cb336be66511713c398765ac15",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We've broken through Reunion's encirclement!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But... they..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "... I... Aaaagh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Shh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...Don't let Amiya hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Amiya's kept a clear head through this! She's a lot more mature than we thought...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "...Ngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "...Mmh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Even if that's the case, we can't let her hear this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We mustn't burden her any further. She's already... carrying the weight of the world on her shoulders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...We can't... let their efforts go to waste!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "They made the ultimate choice to let us live, so we have to return the favor... by making sure Amiya and the Doctor return safely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Now isn't the time to be dejected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "As the Radiant Knight, shouldn't you always be our beacon of hope, no matter what happens?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "... I'm not sure anymore. But, I will do my part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Regroup! Don't let your guard down! We're almost there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Those who told me not to worry... None of them ended up coming back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor {@nickname}...? What happened...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "P-please... let me down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Mm, I'm fine. I can walk on my own..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I just... lost consciousness for a little... but I'm okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...We managed to make it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What about Ace and the others...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I see."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It's okay. I'm sure Ace will be fine."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Everyone in Rhodes Island is very strong."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We're almost at the south exit. Once we leave Chernobog, we'll be..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We'll... be..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... Can I... lean on you for a bit..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Just... a little..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Talulah",
          "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Talulah",
          "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "What a pain."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "How did that guy... manage to do this..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "Half of the city was burnt to ashes, the entire plaza became a sea of flames... Steel was melting and reforming..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mephisto",
          "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "But how was he... able to keep fighting?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "He fought until the bitter end... Impressive."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Talulah",
          "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "I'll remember this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Talulah",
          "speakerId": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "...Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
